{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09058","headline":"郡中对雨赠元锡兼简杨凌 · 韦应物","name":"郡中对雨赠元锡兼简杨凌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宿雨冒空山，空城响秋叶。\n沈沈暮色至，凄凄凉气入。\n萧条林表散，的砾荷上集。\n夜雾着衣重，新苔侵履湿。\n遇兹端忧日，赖与嘉宾接。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09058.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09058","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}